# Intentionally empty. `pnpm deploy` (see ./Dockerfile) selects which files
# to copy into the deployed package by checking, in order: package.json's
# "files" field, then a local .npmignore, then falling back to the root
# .gitignore. The root .gitignore has a blanket `dist/` rule (correct for
# git, since dist is a build artifact) — without this file present, `pnpm
# deploy` would inherit that rule and silently ship without the build
# output. Its mere presence (even empty) short-circuits that fallback.
